{"id":"b9525166bc5de094","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-bool-const.md","title":"布尔域与布尔常数","display":"df-bool-const — 布尔域与布尔常数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-bool-const","aliases":["29-df-bool-const","29-reg-bool-const"],"display":"df-bool-const — 布尔域与布尔常数","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-bool-const"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-bool-const</span><span>29-reg-bool-const</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bool-const — 布尔域与布尔常数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(0,1\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\neq1\">\\(0\\neq1\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bool\\text{-}const}\\vdash\n\\mathbb B\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\n\\qquad 0\\neq1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bool\\text{-}const}\\vdash\n\\mathbb B\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\n\\qquad 0\\neq1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"0,1\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0\\neq1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bool\\text{-}const}\\vdash\n\\mathbb B\\coloneqq\\{0,1\\},\n\\qquad 0\\neq1","display":true}],"bytes":439,"backlinks":[{"id":"1dd8aee3cd4a4360","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ (see [[29-df-bool-const]])"},{"id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ 见 [[29-df-bool-const]]；$\\star\\notin\\mathbb B$ 是固定的额外符号。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$r\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"41143d1e9b3932ce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BVar}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$，$p_i=p_j\\leftrightarrow i=j$；它们是互异布尔变量符号。$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ 取 [[29-df-bool-const]]。所有公式构造子具有不同语法标签。"},{"id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-bool-const]]"}],"outgoing":[]}